{%- comment -%}
  Which custom.* key to read for a specification-group entry.
  Groups list the canonical keys (metaobject lists `x_`, numbers `*_cm`, `putere_w`, `nr_becuri`, booleans)
  and the key is read as listed. The one alternate: lifetime is a number (`autonomie_h`) on most products
  and an option list (`autonomie_`) on the rest.

  Usage: capture this snippet's output (params: product, spec), then read product.metafields.custom[<output>].
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign key_out = spec
  if spec == 'autonomie_h' and product.metafields.custom.autonomie_h.value == blank
    if product.metafields.custom.autonomie_.value != blank
      assign key_out = 'autonomie_'
    endif
  endif
  echo key_out
-%}
